<title>ALBANIA: Albania's Q2 trade gap widens to 17.4 bln leks.</title>
<headline>Albania's Q2 trade gap widens to 17.4 bln leks.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicators:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN FOREIGN TRADE (MLN LEKS)    96 'Q2	 95 'Q2</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance	     -17,423.4    -13,017</p>
<p> Exports					 5,439.4	4,656</p>
<p> Imports					22,862.8     17,673</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
